name: Read real scope boundaries before identifiers and return from full-width detail without changes
size: 120x36
cwd: @REPO/scripts/devex/artifacts/monorepo-scope-live-20261025/attempt-2/target
env-unset: NODE_OPTIONS KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE KUZUSHI_AGENT_MCPS ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY NO_COLOR
env: HOME=@REPO/scripts/devex/artifacts/monorepo-scope-live-20261025/attempt-2/operator-home KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NODE_OPTIONS=--import=@REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/deny_provider_transport.mjs KUZUSHI_TEST_DENIED_FETCH_LOG=@ART/denied-fetch.jsonl
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/live_scope_variant.py @ART inspect
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @REPO/scripts/devex/artifacts/monorepo-scope-live-20261025/attempt-2/target
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
submit: scopes
require-live-snap: 25 DRAFT SCOPES · r2 | decision-first
expect: Boundary: apps/control-panel
expect: Why: Keep the client application
expect: Next study (focused): 3 jobs
expect: Tab read
ask: Does scope review put the component boundary, its rationale and finite workload before detailed source identifiers while keeping the unaccepted state clear?
keys: Tab
require-live-snap: 20 SCOPE DETAIL | detail-reader
expect: Tab / Esc tree
keys: Enter a p c Space
require-live-snap: 20 SCOPE DETAIL | reading-owns-input
expect-not: ACCEPTED SCOPES
resize: 160x48
live-snap: reader-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: reader-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: reader-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: reader-60x20
resize: 40x12
live-snap: reader-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: reader-page-40x12
keys: End
require-live-snap: 20 model requests. | reader-end-40x12
keys: Home
require-live-snap: 20 Control panel client | reader-home-40x12
ask: Is the full-width reader usable at all six sizes, with rationale, source details and return controls reachable without exposing hidden actions while reading?
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 20 DRAFT SCOPES | tree-return-40x12
expect: Control panel
resize: 120x36
keys: Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Right Down
require-live-snap: 20 File: workspace.json | uncovered-file
keys: Tab
require-live-snap: 20 SCOPE DETAIL | uncovered-file-reader
expect: File: workspace.json
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 20 File: workspace.json | file-origin-return
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/live_scope_variant.py @ART inspected
ask: Does returning restore the same tree or uncovered file, with shared context, original proposal, source and exhausted allowance unchanged?
keys: Escape
submit: logs
paste-file: @ART/read-allowance.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 30 Calls committed: 2/2 · remaining: 0 | retained-accounting
expect: Unresolved calls: 0
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@REPO/scripts/devex/artifacts/monorepo-scope-live-20261025/attempt-2/operator-home KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1 NODE_OPTIONS=--import=@REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/deny_provider_transport.mjs KUZUSHI_TEST_DENIED_FETCH_LOG=@ART/denied-fetch.jsonl
launch: --target @REPO/scripts/devex/artifacts/monorepo-scope-live-20261025/attempt-2/target
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
submit: scopes
require-live-snap: 25 DRAFT SCOPES · r2 | recovered-tree
keys: Tab End
require-live-snap: 20 SCOPE DETAIL | no-color-detail-end
keys: Home
require-live-snap: 20 Control panel client | no-color-detail-home
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/live_scope_variant.py @ART restarted
ask: Does no-color restart keep exact source and proposal-context details readable while preserving zero new calls, no accepted scope and no executed discovery?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
